WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A room. A task. Count the passes.
The rest seems like background.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Everyone knows to look for the gorilla.
Knowing the trick changes what you watch.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
This time, you spot it. Then the curtain changes.
Someone walks away.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Did you notice? In a follow-up, familiarity
with the surprise didn't reveal everything else.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Attention selects. It doesn't preserve every event.
One viewing isn't an inventory.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Look again. Change your question.
Keep evidence separate from promises.
